                                "sense_id": "2cc2d661-151e-35d0-8d0f-8f16f554abb4",
                                "text": "The ordeal is a world away from Kira now as she plays games on her new iPad while absently talking about downloading more apps to play music, and voicing her excitement over reuniting soon with her grandfather’s girlfriend."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f0b57b56-135d-4de3-bdb0-bdece79790ba",
                                "sense_id": "2cc2d661-151e-35d0-8d0f-8f16f554abb4",
                                "text": "“This is before everyone had [geographic information system] mapping, before iPads, iPhones, laptops, Google,” he says. “This is doing research way back with a hammer and a chisel.”"
